Package: xournal-sharp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: texlive-base, texlive-latex-extra
Description: Xournal# - handwritten notes and PDF annotation with a GNOME look
 Xournal# is a build of Xournal++ on GTK 4 and libadwaita with a GNOME look:
 Adwaita style, symbolic icons, the desktop's accent colour and automatic
 light/dark switching, a sidebar like GNOME's document viewer and GNOME-style
 dialogs.
 .
 It installs alongside the regular Xournal++ (in /opt/xournal-sharp, started
 with xournal-sharp) and keeps its own settings.
